<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
Your ticket #{{ticketId}} has been drafted to mediate in a new dispute on swap
order <a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">#{{orderId}}</a>
of market <a href="https://app.fiatx.co/market/{{marketAddress}}">#{{shorten
  marketAddress}}</a>. <br> <br>
Once all mediators are drafted, the evidence submission phase will
immediately begin.
In this phase, the counterparties will share evidence for your review.
Although, we will try to notify you when this phase begins, we advise that
your keep track of the dispute progress, review the evidence and vote.
<br><br>
After the evidence submission phase, you will be required to submit your
decision in a voting phase.
<br>
Follow our <a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">step-by-step
  guide</a> to learn about mediation.
<br><br>

<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Swap Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/market/{{marketAddress}}">View Market</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
<b>WARNING</b>
<ul style="color: indianred">
  <li>Failure to vote will lead to your ticket bond getting slashed.</li>
  <li>Losing a vote or voting with the minority will lead to your ticket bond
    getting slashed.
  </li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
